{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not silently accept failed MDC restoration.** With a direct executor, ordinary restoration failures are ignored after the result is settled, so the invocation succeeds while the reused worker may retain corrupted or leaked MDC. Restore through a safe fallback, or complete exceptionally for retry before publishing the result; assert the worker's complete MDC map afterward.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77MbFs","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":292,"observation_digest":"b669bd78922a4e85ba0a84e663ac6b7e3f153b2a2e98f21d2497004c46197916","observation_id":"aro_v1_wzu326esfjhiloqkqttghldlpy","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jyrf7mvlhnckcfrfbuwa7kwgjo","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"1735ff8302326dc678019e4d55498f001e003841","reviewer":"codex","start_line":292,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_yso63vm5m4lb6lxrucwxeak4no","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
